{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/8e5a0b52b1ac4c82844d9e5255f9572b.poster.avif?t=1751266820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/8e5a0b52b1ac4c82844d9e5255f9572b.webm?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/8e5a0b52b1ac4c82844d9e5255f9572b.mp4?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A self-remaster of the 1994 spinoff to Taito's 1987 arcade classic, The NinjaWarriors, with The Ninja Saviors: Return of the Warriors, Tengo Project have taken the original console beat 'em up and reimagined it, adding extra moves &amp; combos, 2 new characters, 2 player co-op, fluid, even more hand animated pixel art and an amped up soundscape to boot! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/58c26d071acd853540992f08e600cc62.poster.avif?t=1751266820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/58c26d071acd853540992f08e600cc62.webm?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/58c26d071acd853540992f08e600cc62.mp4?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Select one of five android ninjas, each with their own unique ninjutsu techniques, and take the battle to Banglar's army alone, or with a ninja partner, as part of Mulk's revolutionary force!<br>Maintaining the original's 16-bit style, Return of the Warriors expands its playfield from 4:3 to a wide 16:9, adding heavily redrawn backgrounds, even more fluidly animated characters and explosive pyrotechnics. The enhanced music comes courtesy of a new, arranged soundtrack, alongside unlockable soundtracks from the 16-bit console original, and arcade version, by Zuntata. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/f21864c8a2ce02eaf8c3a3044a7d5f16.poster.avif?t=1751266820\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/f21864c8a2ce02eaf8c3a3044a7d5f16.webm?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288070/extras/f21864c8a2ce02eaf8c3a3044a7d5f16.mp4?t=1751266820\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Multiple difficulties provide challenge for even the most seasoned ninja, and Time Attack allows you to compete against on the leaderboards against the fastest masters of ninjutsu in the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A 16-bit classic, reborn in full, 16:9 wide screen glory!<br></li><li>Lovingly redrawn, pixel art graphics and smoother animation!<br></li><li>8 stages, 2 difficulties, 2 play modes and multiple unlockables!<br></li><li>5 ninjas with multiple techniques allow for 5 separate play styles!<br></li><li>Punch, kick, slash, juggle, throw, crush and combo your foes!<br></li><li>2 player couch coop for ninja nunchaku action!<br></li><li>Select from Arcade, Again or a new arranged soundtrack!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About TENGO PROJECT</h2>NatsumeAtari's ultra-skilled game-smiths were responsible for bringing titles like <strong>Pocky &amp; Rocky Reshrined</strong>, <strong>WILD GUNS Reloaded</strong> and more to consoles in the 90s and now they're back, better than ever, bringing Technostacy to modern gamers!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crushed Giant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c